⚡️🇩🇪 Hitler's Eagle nest burned down last night, mobilising 200 firemen all night long.

A man going down the mountain on a motorcycle was detained. 

@medmannews

⚡🇱🇧🇺🇸Yesterday, 43 years ago, Hezbollah killed 241 American  personnel (220 Marines, 18 Navy sailors, 3 Army soldiers) in a bombing targeting the Marine barracks in Beirut.

Minutes afterwards, a similar attack collapsed the Drakkar, killing 58 french paratroopers from the 3rd and 9th RCP.


